<title>INDIA: India Tata Power 1996/97 net seen down.</title>
<headline>India Tata Power 1996/97 net seen down.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Electricity firm Tata Power's net profit is forecast to tumble 34.43 percent to 1.46 billion rupees in the year ended March 31, 1997, according to a consensus poll by Reuters.</p>
<p>Analysts at 28 leading securities and brokerage firms</p>
<p>projected earnings at a low of 940 million rupees and a high of</p>
<p>1.96 billion rupees against 2.23 billion a year ago.</p>
<p>.</p>
<p>TATA POWER  ----PAT seen down 34.43%, sales up 0.60%</p>
<p>		     Net profit   1995/96    Net sales   1995/96</p>
<p>				(in million rupees)</p>
<p>Average		1,462.22  2,230.00    11,675.08   11,606.00</p>
<p>High		   1,958.00		  12,366.00</p>
<p>Low			940.00		  10,760.00</p>
<p>--Bombay newsroom +91-22-265-9000</p>
